<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classBundleStorageManagerMT" kindref="compound">BundleStorageManagerMT</ref> class inherits from the <ref refid="classBundleStorageManagerBase" kindref="compound">BundleStorageManagerBase</ref> class and implements writing and reading bundles to and from solid state disk drive(s) using 1 thread per disk drive (i.e. 1 thread per storeFilePath) and uses cross-platform blocking synchronous I/O operations from stdio.h such as fwrite. </para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
